<title>USA: Alcan cuts U.S. July list price by 3 cents.</title>
<headline>Alcan cuts U.S. July list price by 3 cents.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alcan Aluminium Ltd said it has cut its U.S. aluminum ingot list price by 3 cents to 80 cents for July.</p>
<p>The July billet price is also cut by 3 cents to 90 cents.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
